  "CIAAW2024": "CIAAW, Standard Atomic Weights and Abridged Standard Atomic Weights 2024 (the IUPAC \"Atomic Weights 2021\" report, Prohaska et al., Pure Appl. Chem. 2022, 94, 573, with Gd, Lu, Zr revised in 2024). https://www.ciaaw.org/abridged-atomic-weights.htm",
  "IUPAC2021conv": "Conventional atomic weights for the 14 elements whose standard atomic weight is an interval (Prohaska et al. 2022, Table 1, column 7, which replaces the former table of conventional atomic weights; H was expanded from 1.008 to 1.0080); numerically identical to the CIAAW abridged values.",
