  "Cordero2008": "B. Cordero et al., Covalent radii revisited, Dalton Trans. 2008, 2832-2838, doi:10.1039/b801115j (values as reproduced on Wikipedia \"Covalent radius\"; agree with RDKit's copy of the same table).",
